# job 2 must extend the file job 1 wrote: append mode keeps the existing files in
# Job.prepare(), so Task.startWrite() must open the target with APPEND -- both
# createNewFile() (false exactly for the kept file) and a plain truncating open
# would fail the golden. This case was EXPECTED_FAIL until the append path was fixed.
